<title>LEBANON: Solidere A shares hit record low.</title>
<headline>Solidere A shares hit record low.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere A shares hit a record low on Monday on the Beirut Stock Exchange, closing at $10.125 from $10.25 on Friday.</p>
<p>The A shares changed hands all last week on the last record low of $10.25, which they first hit on January 17.</p>
<p>The A shares began trading on the Beirut Secondary Market at $111 in June 1994 or $11.1 after Solidere's 10-for-one stock split which took effect earlier this year.</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (961 1) 745307 345740 345723</p>
